### ProxyPunishments service — runnable request collection.
### Works in IntelliJ IDEA and in VS Code with the REST Client extension.
### Start the stack first: docker compose up --build

@host = http://localhost:8080
@token = dev-local-token
@player = 11111111-2222-3333-4444-555555555555
@admin = 99999999-8888-7777-6666-555555555555

### Health — the only endpoint that needs no token
GET {{host}}/actuator/health

### Register a player so names can be resolved (local mode only)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/known-players
X-Service-Token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uuid": "{{player}}",
  "login": "Steve"
}

### Resolve a name to a UUID
GET {{host}}/api/v1/lookup?name=steve
X-Service-Token: {{token}}

### Issue a permanent ban
POST {{host}}/api/v1/punishments
X-Service-Token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerUuid": "{{player}}",
  "kind": "BAN",
  "issuedByUuid": "{{admin}}",
  "issuedByName": "Admin",
  "reason": "griefing spawn"
}

### Issue a 7-day ban
POST {{host}}/api/v1/punishments
X-Service-Token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerUuid": "{{player}}",
  "kind": "BAN",
  "issuedByUuid": "{{admin}}",
  "issuedByName": "Admin",
  "reason": "chat abuse",
  "durationSeconds": 604800
}

### Issue a 1-hour mute — the ban above stays in force
POST {{host}}/api/v1/punishments
X-Service-Token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerUuid": "{{player}}",
  "kind": "MUTE",
  "issuedByUuid": "{{admin}}",
  "issuedByName": "Admin",
  "reason": "spamming chat",
  "durationSeconds": 3600
}

### Record a warning — log only, never active
POST {{host}}/api/v1/warnings
X-Service-Token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerUuid": "{{player}}",
  "issuedByUuid": "{{admin}}",
  "issuedByName": "Admin",
  "reason": "minor spam"
}

### The ban currently in force (404 when the player is clean; kind defaults to BAN)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/punishments/{{player}}/active
X-Service-Token: {{token}}

### The mute currently in force
GET {{host}}/api/v1/punishments/{{player}}/active?kind=MUTE
X-Service-Token: {{token}}

### Active bans, newest first
GET {{host}}/api/v1/punishments?kind=BAN&limit=20&offset=0
X-Service-Token: {{token}}

### Active mutes, newest first
GET {{host}}/api/v1/punishments?kind=MUTE&limit=20&offset=0
X-Service-Token: {{token}}

### Punishment history — bans, mutes and warnings together
GET {{host}}/api/v1/punishments/{{player}}/history?limit=20&offset=0
X-Service-Token: {{token}}

### Lift the ban
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/punishments/{{player}}?kind=BAN
X-Service-Token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "liftedByUuid": "{{admin}}",
  "liftedByName": "Admin",
  "reason": "appeal accepted"
}

### Lift the mute
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/punishments/{{player}}?kind=MUTE
X-Service-Token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "liftedByUuid": "{{admin}}",
  "liftedByName": "Admin",
  "reason": "cooled down"
}

### Rejected: no token
GET {{host}}/api/v1/punishments/{{player}}/active

### Rejected: limit above the maximum
GET {{host}}/api/v1/punishments?limit=1000000
X-Service-Token: {{token}}

### Rejected: unknown kind
GET {{host}}/api/v1/punishments?kind=KICK
X-Service-Token: {{token}}
